<title>Contact - het Park</title>
<meta id="schema_name" itemprop="name" content="Contact - het Park">


<meta name="description" content="het Park in Rotterdam is a unique place in the city, the national monumental park was designed in 1852 by father and son Zocher. Since 2019, the municipality of Rotterdam and Stichting Droom en Daad have been working on a large-scale renovation, based on the original plans with an eye for today's use. In other words, onward with Zocher.">
