                                <img draggable=" false" src="https://hetparkinrotterdam.nl/media/pages/nieuws/anne-vegter-presenteert-seizoensbundel-herfst/04340de767-1790085194/website-beeld-herfst-600x.jpg"
                    alt="">
                            </figure>
            <div class="subTitle">
                20/09/2026            </div>
            <h1 class="title">Anne Vegter Presents the Seasonal Anthology Herfst            </h1>


            <div class="body">
                <p>On Sunday, September 20, the new Autumn Seasonal Anthology, compiled by poet and author Anne Vegter, was proudly unveiled. During the presentation, illustrator Maaike Hartjes brought Anne’s words to life through her drawings. These unique drawings will be on display at the Park Pavilion throughout the fall.</p>            </div>
                    </a>
